Agent traces for `mrun bench --suite agent --trace crates/mrun/bench/traces/` (005 FR-018, T017).

Recorded 2026-10-17 on the M4 Pro target with `mrun serve --model qwen3.6 --record` while
`scripts/client_gate.py --runs 1 --tasks 01,04,10,11` drove each client through `mrun launch`
on the public task fixtures in `crates/mrun/tests/clients/tasks/` (01-fix-median,
04-find-bug-in-package, 10-long-file, 11-long-session). Built with `mrun bench trace
--tokenizer` (Qwen3.6 tokenizer), then a second redaction pass: the machine's temporary
directory, the client installation id, the time zone and the git user name were replaced, and
the `<available_skills>` block OpenCode copied from the local environment was emptied. Every
assistant turn is a Qwen3.6-35B-A3B 4-bit reply generated by mrun.

